title: "Armenian State Budget Tools"
version: "0.6.0.dev0"
date-released: "2026-05-16"
abstract: "Clean, validated Armenian budget data covering budget laws for 2019-2026, spending reports for 2019-2025, and mid-term expenditure program (MTEP) data for 2024. Parses official Armenian government budget documents into analysis-ready CSVs with full validation and lineage tracking."
